@startuml
title Layers of an embedded USB connection

rectangle "Connector and cable" as connector
rectangle "Power and attach" as power
rectangle "D+ and D- signaling" as signals
rectangle "USB control on EP0" as control
rectangle "Enumeration and configuration" as enumeration
rectangle "USB class\nHID, CDC, MSC" as usb_class
rectangle "Application policy" as policy

connector -down-> power
power -down-> signals
signals -down-> control
control -down-> enumeration
enumeration -down-> usb_class
usb_class -down-> policy
@enduml
